139	/**
140	 * PATCHes a JSON body and returns the parsed JSON response as `T`, throwing on a
141	 * non-ok response (using the response text when present). Mirrors `postJson`: a
142	 * body is only parsed when the response is JSON, so endpoints that answer a
143	 * successful PATCH with an empty body (`Promise<void>` callers) are handled too.
144	 */
